{"5140910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "yttrium X", "steam_appid": 5140910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/7877965f0c7df25093c0c806d344be68.avif?t=1787927150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras_big/7877965f0c7df25093c0c806d344be68.avif?t=1787927150 width=1560 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pilot the yttrium X and deplete the plutocracy's resources, in these retro 2v2 PvE mech battles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech combat in third person featuring beam sabers and cannons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock-on target system for easy aiming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple type of thrusts for momentum based beam saber combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thruster pack that gives you rapid fire and increased speed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a resource based team death match game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy buildings and supplies to deplete the Plutocracy's resources without eliminations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in mulitple arenas based in the Plutocracy's moon base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is timed so you'll have limited time to deplete  resources before a stalemate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/0502c64a99e26af6dd60768f318083a1.poster.avif?t=1787927150\" width=800 height=564 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/0502c64a99e26af6dd60768f318083a1.webm?t=1787927150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/0502c64a99e26af6dd60768f318083a1.mp4?t=1787927150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The year is 900 AF and the upstart pilot Zellia Mots leads a group of space cadets to rebel against humanity’s last governance. The Plutocracy of Yeoman has an academy on the moon where they train experimental mecha suits. Zellia has gone awol and stole the yttrium X. What was the Plutocracy's strongest weapon is now  their downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/cdeb10167007c050861b15417cec3f02.poster.avif?t=1787927150\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/cdeb10167007c050861b15417cec3f02.webm?t=1787927150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/cdeb10167007c050861b15417cec3f02.mp4?t=1787927150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras/7877965f0c7df25093c0c806d344be68.avif?t=1787927150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140910/extras_big/7877965f0c7df25093c0c806d344be68.avif?t=1787927150 width=1560 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pilot the yttrium X and deplete the plutocracy's resources, 